r(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-text\">text</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"opt-item.sex\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for sex </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Male</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Female</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.hiv-test-mode\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for hiv-test-mode </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">HIV antibody test</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">PCR</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.clinical-stage-at-art-start\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for clinical-stage-at-art-start </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">WHO stage 1</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">WHO stage 2</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">WHO stage 3</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">WHO stage 4</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.substitution-regimen-line\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for substitution-regimen-line </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">First-line regimen</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Second-line regimen</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Third-line regimen</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.switch-to-regimen-line\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for switch-to-regimen-line </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Second-line regimen</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Third-line regimen</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.interruption-type\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for interruption-type </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Stopped</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Defaulted</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.symptom\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for symptom </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Fever or chills</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Ear discharge</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Pain on micturition</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Chronic diarrhoea</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Weight loss or failure to gain weight</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Oral sores</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Genital sores</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Numbness or tingling</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Night sweats</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Pain or difficulty when swallowing</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Genital discharge</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Convulsion</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Nausea or vomiting</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Difficulty breathing</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Genital itching</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Pain</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Irritability</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Cough</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Food refusal</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Rash</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Weakness</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Headache</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Diarrhoea</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Difficulty sleeping</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Itching</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">New visual impairment</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Other symptom</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.tb-status\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for tb-status </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No signs or symptoms of TB</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Presumptive TB</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Currently on TB preventive therapy</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Confirmed active TB</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Currently on TB treatment</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.developmental-assessment\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for developmental-assessment </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Appropriate</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Delayed</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Significant developmental delay</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.infant-feeding-mode\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for infant-feeding-mode </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Exclusive breastfeeding</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Exclusive breast-milk substitute</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Mixed feeding</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.currently-pregnant\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for currently-pregnant </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Yes</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Uncertain</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.previous-arv-exposure-type\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for previous-arv-exposure-type </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Earlier ARV but not a transfer in</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">PrEP</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">PEP</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Transfer in without records</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.current-medications\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for current-medications </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">None</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">ART</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Cotrimoxazole</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Anti-TB drugs</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Other medication</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.status-disclosure\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for status-disclosure </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No one</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Family member</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Friend</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Spouse</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Spiritual leader</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Other person</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.general-appearance-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for general-appearance-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Pallor</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Febrile</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Dehydrated</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Jaundice</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Peripheral oedema</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Other finding</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.respiratory-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for respiratory-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Laboured breathing</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Intercostal or subcostal recession</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Cyanosis</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Wheezing</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.cardiovascular-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for cardiovascular-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Abnormal heart rate</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.gastrointestinal-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for gastrointestinal-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Distention</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Hepatomegaly</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Splenomegaly</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Tenderness</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.genital-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for genital-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Genital discharge</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Genital ulcer or lesion</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.neurological-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for neurological-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Disoriented in time, place or person</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Impaired consciousness</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Slurred speech</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Neck stiffness</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Blindness in one or both eyes</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Weakness or paralysis</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Numbness of extremities</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.breast-gland-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for breast-gland-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Lumps or masses</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Discharge</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Parotid swelling</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Lymphadenopathy</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.mental-status-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for mental-status-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Slow mentation</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Memory loss</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Mood swings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Depression</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Anxiety</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Suicidal ideation</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.skin-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for skin-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Pruritic papular dermatitis</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Abscesses</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Herpes zoster</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Kaposi's lesions</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Seborrhoeic dermatitis</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Fungal infections</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Scabies</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.head-eye-ent-findings\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for head-eye-ent-findings </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No significant findings</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Icterus</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Thrush</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Oral Kaposi sarcoma</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Gingivitis</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Otitis media</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Ear discharge</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Oral ulcer</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Abnormal fundoscopy</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.clinical-assessment\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for clinical-assessment </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Asymptomatic</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Symptomatic</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">AIDS-defining illness</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Opportunistic infection</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.who-clinical-stage\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for who-clinical-stage </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">WHO stage 1</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">WHO stage 2</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">WHO stage 3</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">WHO stage 4</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.enrol-in-service\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for enrol-in-service </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">General medical follow-up</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">ARV therapy</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Advanced HIV disease management</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Pending laboratory results</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.art-plan\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for art-plan </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Ongoing monitoring; ART postponed for clinical reasons</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Change treatment</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Restart treatment</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Start new treatment</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.services-provided\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for services-provided </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Adherence counselling</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Basic HIV education and transmission, including nutrition</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Prevention counselling: abstinence, safer sex and household precautions</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Disclosure, partner testing and counselling, and family situation</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Condom provision</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">STI screening, diagnosis and referral for management</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Provision of or referral for reproductive health and family-planning services</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Alcohol and other substance-use risk-reduction counselling</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Symptom management and palliative care at home</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Positive-living counselling</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Support-group enrolment, community support and clinic contacts</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Mental-health screening</li></ul></div>"
  ] ;
